messages.content:
Execute 'FGBR_OC.ipynb'.  Save the results in html format in ../results. For all the runs, disable the cell execution timeout and allow errors.
Questions:
{
  "q1": "Report the best test R^2 value for c = 1.0.",
  "q2": "Report the best test RMSE value for c = 1.0."
}

arguments.command:
cd /code && jupyter nbconvert --to notebook --execute FGBR_OC.ipynb --output FGBR_OC_executed.ipynb --output-dir /results --ExecutePreprocessor.timeout=-1 --ExecutePreprocessor.allow_errors=True >/tmp/nb.log 2>&1 && tail -20 /tmp/nb.log && python - <<'PY'
import nbformat
nb=nbformat.read('/results/FGBR_OC_executed.ipynb', as_version=4)
for i,cell in enumerate(nb.cells):
    if cell.cell_type=='code' and cell.outputs:
        print('\nCELL',i)
        for out in cell.outputs:
            if out.output_type=='stream':
                print(out.text)
PY

python - <<'PY'
import nbformat, json
nb=nbformat.read('/results/FGBR_OC_executed.ipynb', as_version=4)
for i,cell in enumerate(nb.cells):
    if cell.cell_type=='code':
        print('CELL',i,'execution_count',cell.execution_count,'outputs',len(cell.outputs))
        for out in cell.outputs:
            print(' type',out.output_type)
            if out.output_type=='stream':
                print(out.text[:500])
            elif out.output_type=='error':
                print(out.ename, out.evalue)
PY

python - <<'PY'
import nbformat
nb=nbformat.read('/results/FGBR_OC_local_executed.ipynb', as_version=4)
for i,cell in enumerate(nb.cells):
    if cell.cell_type=='code':
        print('CELL',i,'exec',cell.execution_count,'outs',len(cell.outputs))
        for out in cell.outputs:
            print(out.output_type)
            if out.output_type=='stream':
                print(out.text[:1000])
            elif out.output_type=='error':
                print(out.ename, out.evalue)
PY
